  Qikify Section 4: Artwork Upload / the file input.

  Path A — Upload vector via the form field (guarded to .ai .eps .cdr .pdf .svg).
  Path B — Create a mockup (Streamlit ?mode=customer), download PDF, reattach.

  QA: VM Corporate Gifting and Custom Orders (Hidden), template custom-2026-2.
  Before go-live on NEW Corporate Gifting:
  1. Set mockup_return to this page’s stable storefront URL.
  2. Confirm Streamlit Community Cloud app is Public.
{% endcomment %}

{% assign mockup_app = 'https://virtual-mockup-85kxgyfvpa82a669bqjuqg.streamlit.app' %}
{% comment %} Prefer a stable /pages/... handle for return= once VM is Visible-but-unlisted. {% endcomment %}
{% assign mockup_return = 'https://csfw7ylm5v4xqt8p-86720348463.shopifypreview.com/pages?preview_key=969b7098a0171bccfe6ed35420643970' %}

<style>
